The  driver  provides  support for the Environment Controller and
the Watchdog Timer on the Super I/Os, and may be used to  monitor
hardware  sensors  or setting up a watchdog timeout value for the
system.  The driver has 15 sensors: The Watchdog Timer is config‐
urable via the utility and has a resolution between 1  and  65535
seconds.  The Watchdog Timer is not supported on the IT8705 Super
I/O.   The  driver  first  appeared in and was then ported to The
driver was written by and Interrupt support is unimplemented.
